  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pair: {締|し}まる (intransitive). Pattern: Xを{締|し}める.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {閉|し}める - to close\n- {締|し}める - to tighten (this entry)\n- {占|し}める - to occupy\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ねじを{締|し}める (to tighten a screw)\n- ベルトを{締|し}める (to fasten a belt)\n- ネクタイを{締|し}める (to tie a necktie)\n- {気|き}を{引|ひ}き{締|し}める (to brace oneself)\n- {締|し}め{切|き}り (deadline; from {締|し}める + {切|き}る)",
